      "answer": "NoteNest automatically synchronizes notes across signed-in devices when connected to the internet. Changes made while offline are stored locally and uploaded once the device reconnects, with synchronization typically beginning within 10 seconds of the connection being restored. If a note is edited on two devices while both are offline, NoteNest keeps the most recently saved version.",
